lper(node.right, node.val, max_val)\n        \n        return left_valid and right_valid\n\n    # Start the validation with the minimum possible value and maximum possible value\n    # Initially, the min and max are set to negative infinity and positive infinity\n    return helper(root, float('-inf'), float('inf'))\n```\n\n### Explanation:\n- The function uses a helper recursive function to perform an in-order traversal of the tree.\n- During the traversal, it checks if the current node's value is within the valid range defined by the minimum and maximum values.\n- The helper function ensures",
